    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me, under Section 92 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Act, No.02 of1974, I, Rauff Hakeem, the Minister of City Planning, Water Supply, and Higher Education, do hereby approve theacquisition of servitude rights over the lands, described in the following Schedule, as it is required by the National WaterSupply and Drainage Board, for construction of access road to the Weragoda Water Storage Tank under GaligamuwaWater Supply Project.",
